UID:ace-national-portfolio-investment-programme-2028-33@artificialnouveau.g
 ithub.io
DTSTAMP:20261106T131416Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261215
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
SUMMARY:Deadline: Arts Council England: National Portfolio Investment Progr
 amme 2028-33 (five-year funding for organisations in England)
DESCRIPTION:Arts Council England has opened applications for its next Natio
 nal Portfolio\, the core structural funding programme for England's cultur
 al sector. For the first time the programme offers five-year funding from 
 the outset\, covering April 2028 to March 2033\, after the current portfol
 io was extended to March 2028.\n\nOrganisation: Arts Council England\nLoca
 tion: England\, UK. For arts organisations\, non-national museums and libr
 aries based in England.\nAward: Annual funding from April 2028 to March 20
 33. Minimum request GBP 50\,000 per year\, no maximum\; current National P
 ortfolio Organisations received a planning figure in September 2026 (their
  2026/27 investment plus the 5 percent uplift). No application fee.\nDurat
 ion: Five years\, 1 April 2028 to 31 March 2033. Assessment December 2026 
 to June 2027\; decisions announced July 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.artscou
 ncil.org.uk/NationalPortfolio28?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_
 medium=referral
URL:https://www.artscouncil.org.uk/NationalPortfolio28?utm_source=artificia
 lnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:England\, UK. For arts organisations\, non-national museums and li
 braries based in England.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
